{"seq":3,"slug":"classical-text","title":"高三语文 — 文言文阅读","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chinese/gaokao-reading/classical-text","wordCount":2127,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高三语文-文言文阅读\">高三语文 — 文言文阅读</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>文言文阅读在高考语文中占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 分左右（选择 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 翻译 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 简答），是&quot;高投入高回报&quot;的板块。近年命题选材以&quot;二十四史&quot;为主（《史记》《汉书》《后汉书》《资治通鉴》等），兼有先秦诸子散文和唐宋古文。题型稳定：断句选择题、文化常识选择题、内容概括选择题、翻译题（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 小题，各 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 分或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 分），部分省份增设简答题。突破文言文的关键在于&quot;实词过关、虚词通达、句式了然、翻译精准&quot;。</p>\n<p>高考文言文核心考点体系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>考点</th>\n<th>典型题型</th>\n<th>备考重点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>文言实词</td>\n<td>融入翻译题考查</td>\n<td>掌握 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 个高频实词的多义项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文言虚词</td>\n<td>融入断句/翻译考查</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span></span></span></span></span> 个高频虚词的用法辨析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文言句式</td>\n<td>翻译中重点考查</td>\n<td>判断句、被动句、倒装句、省略句</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>断句</td>\n<td>选择题</td>\n<td>抓主语切换和句末语气词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文化常识</td>\n<td>选择题</td>\n<td>官职、科举、礼仪、纪年</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容概括</td>\n<td>选择题</td>\n<td>精准比对原文与选项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>翻译</td>\n<td>主观题</td>\n<td>关键词逐个落实，字字有着落</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-文言实词攻略\">一、文言实词攻略</h3><p>文言实词是文言文阅读的基石。高考大纲规定的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 个实词并非孤立考查，而是融入翻译和理解之中。备考策略是以&quot;义项辨析&quot;为核心，而非死记硬背。</p>\n<p><strong>高频多义实词举例</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实词</th>\n<th>义项</th>\n<th>例句</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>举</td>\n<td>①举起 ②推荐 ③全、尽 ④攻克 ⑤发动</td>\n<td>②&quot;举孝廉&quot;；③&quot;举国欢庆&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>疾</td>\n<td>①疾病 ②痛恨 ③快速 ④通&quot;嫉&quot;，嫉妒</td>\n<td>②&quot;疾恶如仇&quot;；③&quot;疾驰&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兵</td>\n<td>①武器 ②士兵 ③军队 ④战争 ⑤军事策略</td>\n<td>①&quot;短兵相接&quot;；④&quot;兵连祸结&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故</td>\n<td>①原因 ②旧的 ③故意 ④所以 ⑤通&quot;固&quot;</td>\n<td>①&quot;何故&quot;；④&quot;故天将降大任&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>实词推断方法</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>语境推断法</strong>：根据上下文判断词义。如&quot;帝嘉其忠&quot;中&quot;嘉&quot;应为&quot;赞赏&quot;，因为语境是皇帝对忠臣的正面评价。</li>\n<li><strong>字形推断法</strong>：利用汉字构造推测词义。如&quot;赍&quot;从贝，与财物有关，义为&quot;送给&quot;&quot;赠送&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>语法推断法</strong>：根据词在句中的位置判断词性。如&quot;春风又绿江南岸&quot;中&quot;绿&quot;处于谓语位置，应为动词&quot;使……变绿&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>成语印证法</strong>：利用成语中保留的古义。如&quot;殚精竭虑&quot;中&quot;殚&quot;为&quot;尽&quot;义，可迁移到文言文理解中。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"二-文言虚词系统\">二、文言虚词系统</h3><p>高考重点考查 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>18</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">18</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18</span></span></span></span></span> 个文言虚词：而、何、乎、乃、其、且、若、所、为、焉、也、以、因、于、与、则、者、之。</p>\n<p><strong>最高频虚词辨析</strong>：</p>\n<p><strong>&quot;以&quot;的主要用法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>介词：用（&quot;以刀劈之&quot;）、因为（&quot;以其无礼于晋&quot;）、凭借（&quot;以勇气闻于诸侯&quot;）</li>\n<li>连词：表目的（&quot;作《师说》以贻之&quot;）、表修饰（&quot;木欣欣以向荣&quot;）</li>\n<li>动词：认为（&quot;皆以美于徐公&quot;）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>&quot;之&quot;的主要用法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>代词：他/她/它（&quot;公与之乘&quot;）</li>\n<li>助词：的（&quot;古之学者&quot;）、取消句子独立性（&quot;师道之不传也久矣&quot;）、凑音节（&quot;久之&quot;）</li>\n<li>动词：到……去（&quot;吾欲之南海&quot;）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"三-文言句式辨识\">三、文言句式辨识</h3><p>特殊句式是翻译题的核心采分点。四大句式必须在翻译中准确还原：</p>\n<p><strong>判断句</strong>常见标志：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>&quot;……者，……也&quot;（&quot;陈胜者，阳城人也&quot;）</li>\n<li>&quot;……，……也&quot;（&quot;夫战，勇气也&quot;）</li>\n<li>&quot;乃&quot;&quot;即&quot;&quot;则&quot;&quot;是&quot;（&quot;当立者乃公子扶苏&quot;）</li>\n<li>无标志判断句（&quot;刘备，天下枭雄&quot;）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>被动句</strong>常见标志：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>&quot;为……所……&quot;（&quot;为秦人积威之所劫&quot;）</li>\n<li>&quot;见……于……&quot;（&quot;臣诚恐见欺于王而负赵&quot;）</li>\n<li>&quot;于&quot;字被动（&quot;受制于人&quot;）</li>\n<li>无标志被动句（&quot;戍卒叫，函谷举&quot;中&quot;举&quot;为&quot;被攻破&quot;）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>倒装句</strong>类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>倒装类型</th>\n<th>正常语序</th>\n<th>倒装语序</th>\n<th>例句</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>宾语前置</td>\n<td>动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 宾</td>\n<td>宾 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 动</td>\n<td>&quot;何陋之有&quot;→&quot;有何陋&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状语后置</td>\n<td>状 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 动</td>\n<td>动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 状</td>\n<td>&quot;青，取之于蓝&quot;→&quot;青，于蓝取之&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定语后置</td>\n<td>定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 名</td>\n<td>名 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 定</td>\n<td>&quot;石之铿然有声者&quot;→&quot;铿然有声之石&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主谓倒装</td>\n<td>主 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 谓</td>\n<td>谓 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 主</td>\n<td>&quot;甚矣，汝之不惠&quot;→&quot;汝之不惠甚矣&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"四-断句技巧\">四、断句技巧</h3><p>断句选择题通常给出一段未加标点的文言文，四个选项提供不同的断句方式。</p>\n<p><strong>断句核心方法</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>找名词定主语</strong>：文言文的主语切换处一般就是断句处。人名、官职名、代词出现时考虑断句。</li>\n<li><strong>找句末语气词</strong>：如&quot;也&quot;&quot;矣&quot;&quot;乎&quot;&quot;哉&quot;&quot;耳&quot;&quot;焉&quot;后通常断开。</li>\n<li><strong>找句首发语词</strong>：如&quot;夫&quot;&quot;盖&quot;&quot;且夫&quot;&quot;若夫&quot;前通常断开。</li>\n<li><strong>找对称结构</strong>：文言文讲究对仗，对称结构处断句一致。</li>\n<li><strong>找引文标志</strong>：如&quot;曰&quot;&quot;云&quot;&quot;言&quot;后断开。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>断句验证：断开后每个分句应语意通顺、语法完整。如果某个分句出现主语缺失或动宾搭配不当，说明断句有误。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-翻译的-信达雅\">五、翻译的&quot;信达雅&quot;</h3><p>高考翻译要求&quot;字字有着落，句句有交代&quot;，核心采分方式是关键词踩点。</p>\n<p>翻译六字原则：<strong>留、删、补、换、调、贯</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原则</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>留</td>\n<td>保留人名、地名、年号</td>\n<td>&quot;元和十年&quot;直接保留</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>删</td>\n<td>删去无实义虚词</td>\n<td>&quot;师道之不传也久矣&quot;中&quot;之&quot;&quot;也&quot;翻译时不体现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>补</td>\n<td>补出省略成分</td>\n<td>&quot;（帝）见其奏，大悦&quot;需补主语&quot;皇帝&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>换</td>\n<td>用现代汉语替换古义词</td>\n<td>&quot;走&quot;→&quot;跑&quot;，&quot;去&quot;→&quot;离开&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调</td>\n<td>调整倒装语序</td>\n<td>&quot;何以知之&quot;→&quot;凭什么知道这件事&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贯</td>\n<td>使译文通顺连贯</td>\n<td>直译为主，个别处意译使语句流畅</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>翻译采分点类型</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>实词翻译（每个关键实词 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 分）</li>\n<li>虚词翻译（如&quot;以&quot;的介词义）</li>\n<li>句式还原（被动句、倒装句须在译文中体现）</li>\n<li>语句通顺（整体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 分）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"六-文化常识备考策略\">六、文化常识备考策略</h3><p>文化常识题覆盖面广但考查深度有限，备考策略是&quot;高频优先、适度拓展&quot;。</p>\n<p>高频文化常识分类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>常考内容</th>\n<th>易混点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>官职</td>\n<td>拜、除、迁、谪、转、调、擢、黜</td>\n<td>&quot;迁&quot;可升可降；&quot;左迁&quot;为贬</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>科举</td>\n<td>乡试（举人）、会试（贡士）、殿试（进士）</td>\n<td>&quot;中举&quot;是乡试不是殿试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纪年</td>\n<td>年号纪年、干支纪年</td>\n<td>年号可多次更改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>礼仪</td>\n<td>冠礼（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 岁男子）、笄礼（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 岁女子）</td>\n<td>&quot;弱冠&quot;指 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 岁左右</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理</td>\n<td>山南水北为&quot;阳&quot;，反之为&quot;阴&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;江阴&quot;在长江南岸</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>用&quot;语境推断法&quot;和&quot;字形推断法&quot;分别推测以下实词的含义：①&quot;帝以谦让闻&quot;中的&quot;以&quot;；②&quot;赍钱三百万&quot;中的&quot;赍&quot;；③&quot;朝服衣冠&quot;中&quot;服&quot;。</li>\n<li>断句练习：对以下文段进行断句——&quot;太祖少好飞鹰走狗游荡无度叔父数言之于嵩嵩辄呵责太祖太祖患之&quot;。写出断句理由。</li>\n<li>翻译以下句子，注意标出采分点：①&quot;臣诚恐见欺于王而负赵&quot;；②&quot;古之人不余欺也&quot;；③&quot;夫祸患常积于忽微，而智勇多困于所溺&quot;。</li>\n<li>整理近五年全国卷文化常识题中出现的所有知识点，标注重复出现的高频考点。</li>\n<li>选取《史记》任一列传（推荐《廉颇蔺相如列传》或《魏公子列传》），通篇翻译一遍，每段标注特殊句式和重要实词。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>王力《古代汉语》是文言文学习的经典教材，其中&quot;常用词&quot;部分与高考 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 实词高度重合。</li>\n<li>《古文观止》收录了从先秦到清代的经典散文，适合课外积累文言语感。</li>\n<li>高考真题翻译题的评分细则（可在各省考试院网站查找）能帮助理解踩分点的设置规律。</li>\n<li>《史记》《资治通鉴》是高考选材的两大核心文本，通读其中重要篇章既能提升阅读速度又能积累文化常识。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>文言文阅读的备考策略可以概括为&quot;四项基本功&quot;：实词义项积累（重点掌握 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>120</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">120</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">120</span></span></span></span></span> 个高频实词的多义项和推断方法）、虚词用法辨析（以&quot;以&quot;&quot;之&quot;&quot;而&quot;&quot;其&quot;为核心）、句式识别还原（判断句、被动句、倒装句、省略句在翻译中必须体现）、翻译技巧运用（留删补换调贯六字法，关键词逐个踩点）。断句靠&quot;找主语、找语气词、找对称&quot;三板斧，文化常识靠高频优先、分类整理。每周至少精练 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 篇完整的文言文阅读真题，积累到一定量后文言文将成为稳定的得分区。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高三语文 — 文言文阅读","id":"高三语文-文言文阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、文言实词攻略","id":"一-文言实词攻略"},{"level":3,"text":"二、文言虚词系统","id":"二-文言虚词系统"},{"level":3,"text":"三、文言句式辨识","id":"三-文言句式辨识"},{"level":3,"text":"四、断句技巧","id":"四-断句技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"五、翻译的\"信达雅\"","id":"五-翻译的-信达雅"},{"level":3,"text":"六、文化常识备考策略","id":"六-文化常识备考策略"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高三语文 — 实用类文本阅读","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chinese/gaokao-reading/practical-text"},"next":{"title":"高三语文 — 议论文写作","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chinese/gaokao-writing/argument-essay"}}